// What each movement base trains: its movement pattern, and the muscle groups it works as the
// primary mover and as a secondary one. Weekly hard sets on the Train page and in the training
// score are counted from this file. Edit an entry to correct it; the build embeds the file, so
// `dotnet run` picks up a change with nothing else to do.
//
// - "base" is the movement base's name. Matching ignores case and surrounding spaces. Every
//   variation of a base (incline, paused, dumbbell, machine) shares its entry.
// - "pattern" is one of: horizontalPush, verticalPush, horizontalPull, verticalPull, squat, hinge,
//   singleLeg, isolation, other. Push patterns count toward push, pull patterns toward pull, and
//   squat, hinge and single-leg toward legs. An isolation or other movement counts toward the
//   family of its first primary muscle group (curls toward pull, lateral raises toward push, ab
//   work toward core, which the score does not judge).
// - "primary" and "secondary" name muscle groups: chest, frontDelts, sideDelts, rearDelts,
//   triceps, lats, upperBack, biceps, forearms, quads, hamstrings, glutes, adductors, calves,
//   lowerBack, abs. A set counts as one set for each primary group and half a set for each
//   secondary one (Pelland et al., Sports Medicine 2026).
// - "unsure" marks an entry that was a judgement call, and says why. The app shows it as unsure
//   until the athlete confirms or corrects it there. Delete the field once settled.
// - A classification the athlete states in the app replaces the entry here for that base.
// - A base with no entry is unclassified: its sets are listed as unplaced, never guessed at.
[
  { "base": "Ab Rollout", "pattern": "other", "primary": ["abs"], "secondary": ["lats"] },
  { "base": "Archer Row", "pattern": "horizontalPull", "primary": ["lats", "upperBack"], "secondary": ["biceps", "rearDelts"], "unsure": "A single-arm cable row with a wide sweep; read as a row rather than a pulldown." },
  { "base": "Back Extension", "pattern": "hinge", "primary": ["lowerBack", "glutes"], "secondary": ["hamstrings"] },
  { "base": "Bench Press", "pattern": "horizontalPush", "primary": ["chest"], "secondary": ["frontDelts", "triceps"] },
  { "base": "Bent Over Row", "pattern": "horizontalPull", "primary": ["upperBack", "lats"], "secondary": ["biceps", "rearDelts", "lowerBack"] },
  { "base": "Bicep Curl", "pattern": "isolation", "primary": ["biceps"], "secondary": ["forearms"] },
  { "base": "Calf Press", "pattern": "isolation", "primary": ["calves"], "secondary": [] },
  { "base": "Calf Raise", "pattern": "isolation", "primary": ["calves"], "secondary": [] },
  { "base": "Chest Fly", "pattern": "isolation", "primary": ["chest"], "secondary": ["frontDelts"] },
  { "base": "Chest Press", "pattern": "horizontalPush", "primary": ["chest"], "secondary": ["frontDelts", "triceps"] },
  { "base": "Chin Up", "pattern": "verticalPull", "primary": ["lats", "biceps"], "secondary": ["upperBack"] },
